  "releaseNotes": "ParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.10:\n\t\t\t\t- AdaptiveSimplexOptimization: maximumIterations fixed.\n\t\t\t\t- AdaptiveSimplexOptimization refactored.\n\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.8:\n\t\t\t\t- AdaptiveSimplexOptimization (Nelder-Mead Simplex) added.\n\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.7:\n\t\t\t\t- StoppingCriteria strategy changed. If any of the stopping criteria is true, then CanStop() returns true. \n\t\t\t\t**Heads up**: In previous versions, all stopping criteria had to be true for CanStop() to return true.\n\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.6:\n\t\t\t\t- RunNMOptAndMoveParticles\n\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.5:\n\t\t\t\t- Bugfixed: Nelder-Mead Simplex MaximumIterationsException\n\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.4:\n\t\t\t\t- Nelder-Mead PSO. A hybrid implementation of PSO in combination with Nelder-Mead Simplex optimizer.\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.3:\n\t\t\t\t- User defined particle position update\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.2:\n\t\t\t\t- Custom seed for the random engine added\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tParticleSwarmOptimization 1.0.1:\n\t\t\t\t- ParticleSwarmMaximization added\n\t\t\t\t- ParticleSwarmMinimization added",
